age effectiveness), health-checking for tablet servers through heartbeat, recovery (handle the permanent loss of a tablet server) based on WAL (write-ahead log) and metadata, and start/kill the servers. The tablet servers support garbage collection (only keep the last five inserted values), maintaining the memtable for effective searching (memtable would spilled to disk when there are a hundred unique row keys exists), maintaining the in-memory indexes, sharding when a table contains more than 1000 row keys, WAL, reconstructing the tablet server state using WAL and SSTables maintained in the persistent storage, effective range searching in SSTables.","topics":[],"score":258731,"global_rank":51433,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9594},{"name":"vivlim/blender-image-saver","owner":"vivlim","html_url":"https://github.com/vivlim/blender-image-saver","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Automatically saves modified images when you save the .blend file that uses them.","topics":[],"score":258727,"global_rank":51438,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9595},{"name":"DuyNguyenPhuong/AI_Iterative_Deepening_Search","owner":"DuyNguyenPhuong","html_url":"https://github.com/DuyNguyenPhuong/AI_Iterative_Deepening_Search","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":258727,"global_rank":51439,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9596},{"name":"gstoica27/cpg_ppo","owner":"gstoica27","html_url":"https://github.com/gstoica27/cpg_ppo","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":258723,"global_rank":51442,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9597},{"name":"SiqiD47/vision2019","owner":"SiqiD47","html_url":"https://github.com/SiqiD47/vision2019","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":258723,"global_rank":51444,"on_pypi":fals